<v Dante Nero>And there was nigger this and nigger that, Nazi this. And there was, like, this white supremacist stuff. And I'm like, "I'm the pope. You're talking about black people like this." There's pictures of, you know, the old cartoons with the black dudes with the big lips and the bone. Like, there was all this stuff on it, and I was like "yo!" I even said this to Gavin. I go, "man, I'm not really comfortable with this at all. Because they're talking about me!" And Gavin actually screamed on them and said, "listen, the pope doesn't want to come on anymore, because all this racist stuff needs to stop."
<v Dante Nero>到处都是“黑鬼”（nigger）这个，那个的，纳粹这个。而且有，比如，这种白人至上主义的东西。我就说，“我是教皇。你们正在这样谈论黑人。”有照片，你知道，那种老的漫画，有着大嘴唇和骨头的黑人家伙。就像，上面有所有这些东西，我说“嘿！”我甚至对加文说了。我说，“伙计，我一点也不舒服。因为他们在谈论我！”加文实际上对他们尖叫，并说，“听着，教皇不想再来了，因为所有这些种族主义的东西都需要停止。”

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:57.080
<v Dante Nero>So he actually took a stand with it, but you've already done everything to kind of get these guys to that point already. Like, how do you make a left turn off of that once they're already there?
<v Dante Nero>所以他实际上对此表明了立场，但你已经做了所有事情来促使这些人达到那个程度了。比如，一旦他们已经在那里了，你如何让他们左转回来？

00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:06.090
<v Zoe Chace>I guess that's what I wonder is like, did you have a theory in your mind as to why all this racist stuff was showing up on a Proud Boy's Facebook page?
<v Zoe Chace>我想这就是我好奇的地方，你心里有没有一个理论，关于为什么所有这些种族主义的东西会出现在“骄傲男孩”的Facebook页面上？

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:33.710
<v Dante Nero>It was the natural progression. I think it was the natural progression in terms of "OK, we're the greatest. We're this." You're not! You're 22 years old. You haven't done anything. I'm not saying that they don't have the potential to be great, but who's great at 22? And your whiteness doesn't make you great. Neither does my blackness make me great. It's the content of what I do on a day to day basis, and how I operate on a day to day basis. But when you are in this vacuum and everybody's jerking each other off-- I mean funny--
<v Dante Nero>这是自然的发展。我认为这是自然的发展，就是说“好的，我们是最伟大的。我们是这个。”你不是！你22岁。你什么都没做。我不是说他们没有伟大的潜力，但谁在22岁时伟大呢？你的白人身份并不能让你伟大。我的黑人身份也不能让我伟大。这取决于我每天所做的事情的内容，以及我每天运作的方式。但当你处在这个真空中，每个人都在互相自慰——我的意思是好笑——

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:35.310
<v Zoe Chace>I mean, maybe not.
<v Zoe Chace>我的意思是，也许不是。

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:55.700
<v Dante Nero>Right, maybe not, but socially jerking each other, "we're great, we're the best," where is growth? If you're already great, where is the need for growth?
<v Dante Nero>对，也许不是，但从社交上互相自慰，“我们很伟大，我们是最好的，”成长在哪里？如果你已经很伟大了，哪里需要成长？

00:21:55.700 --> 00:22:05.570
