<v Gavin Mcinnes>We've got Jason Kessler on the line, right? Is he still there? He's over there in Virginia, near Washington DC. Where are you?
<v Gavin Mcinnes>我们要和杰森·凯斯勒连线，对吗？他还在那吗？他在弗吉尼亚，离华盛顿特区很近。你在哪？

00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:24.860
<v Jason Kessler>Yeah, I'm here in Charlottesville, Virginia, where we're going to have the Unite the Right rally on August 12th. It's going to be international news, so you won't forget it. Charlottesville, Virginia.
