00:22:33.500 --> 00:22:40.880
<v Jason Kessler>I want to stand up for white people. I want to stand up for Western civilization. I want to stand up for men. I want to stand up for Christians.
<v Jason Kessler>我想为白人挺身而出。我想为西方文明挺身而出。我想为男人挺身而出。我想为基督徒挺身而出。

