00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:49.730
<v Zoe Chace>Shortly after that it seems Jason became a Proud Boy himself, second degree. Punches, breakfast cereals.
<v Zoe Chace>在那之后不久，似乎杰森自己也成为了“骄傲男孩”，二级。拳打，早餐谷物。

00:22:49.730 --> 00:22:52.190
<v Gavin Mcinnes>Thanks for coming on the show. I like you more than a friend.
