00:22:54.170 --> 00:23:00.710
<v Zoe Chace>That's what Gavin always says at the end of an interview for some reason. He was unsure whether to endorse this event or not.
<v Zoe Chace>那是加文出于某种原因在采访结束时总是说的话。他不确定是否要支持这次活动。

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:10.280
<v Gavin Mcinnes>He's a nice boy. I go back and forth on that thing. It has Confederate flags on it and stuff. On the one hand, I'm not-- I'm not scared of being associated with Richard Spencer. On the other hand--
<v Gavin Mcinnes>他是个好孩子。在那件事上我反复权衡。它有联盟旗帜之类的东西。一方面，我不——我不怕与理查德·斯宾塞（Richard Spencer）联系在一起。另一方面——

