00:28:20.170 --> 00:28:32.620
<v Dante Nero>I think a lot of them could. I think it could. I think they're susceptible to it. I think given the right combination of things happening and the right timing, yeah.
<v Dante Nero>我认为他们中的很多人会。我认为会的。我认为他们很容易受到影响。我认为鉴于发生的事情的正确组合和正确的时机，是的。

