00:57:56.070 --> 00:58:15.240
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks as always to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he just finished learning to speak Japanese. He picked up the language in just three months, because of all the spare time he had. So much spare time. You know why?
<v Ira Glass>我们的网站，thisamericanlife.org。《美国生活》由PRX，公共广播交易所交付给公共广播电台。像往常一样感谢我们节目的联合创始人，托雷·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生。你知道，他刚刚学会说日语。他只用了三个月就学会了这门语言，因为他有所有的业余时间。那么多业余时间。你知道为什么吗？

00:58:15.240 --> 00:58:18.000
<v Dante Nero>I decided not to watch porn anymore.
<v Dante Nero>我决定不再看色情片了。

00:58:18.000 --> 00:58:23.000
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周回来带来更多《美国生活》的故事。
